\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Mayor Lesser introduced Environmental Programs Administrator Britny Coker-Moen, who gave a brief presentation and recognized Lisa Ryder Moore for administering the Green Business Program and leading the City\rquote s compost workshops.\cf1\i0\line\line\cf0\i On behalf of the City Council, Mayor Lesser presented Certificates of Recognition to the following Manhattan Beach Businesses for attaining certification as a Green Business as part of the California Green Business Network:\line\line Bar Au Chocolat\line Denton & Denton Group\line LMarie\rquote Sea Treasures\line Manhattan Beach City Hall\line Manhattan Beach Nursery School\line Organique Natural Organic Skincare\line Salon Flourish\line Sloopy\rquote s Inc.\line SPATH\'c9N\'c9\'c9 Wellness Center - Manhattan Beach\line\pard Stretch Lyfe\cf2\i0\f1\par
