\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Mayor Pro Tem Franklin reported that he attended the United States Conference of Mayors in Washington, D.C., where he gained ideas for the upcoming 250th Anniversary of America celebration, explored traffic engineering strategies, and received a presentation from the Mayor of Minneapolis.\line\line\pard Councilmember Tarnay reported that she and Councilmember Howorth attended the MEGA event, hosted by the Manhattan Beach Chamber of Commerce and other sponsors, along with local agencies. The event provided valuable information on preparing for major upcoming events such as the Olympics, FIFA World Cup, and the Super Bowl, and offered a great opportunity to connect and collaborate with others on strategies for the City\rquote s readiness.\cf1\i0\f1\par
